---
// Only on the private design preview (EVENTS_PREVIEW=1).
---
<div class="preview" role="region" aria-label="Preview site notice">
  <div class="wrap row">
    <p><strong>Design preview.</strong> Not the live calendar. City events are real; anything tagged <span class="tag-s">Sample</span> is a placeholder to show how your own listings will look.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .preview { background: var(--base); color: var(--white); font-size: var(--text-m); }
  .row { padding-block-start: var(--space-xs); padding-block-end: var(--space-xs); }
  .tag-s { font-size: var(--text-xs); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 0.125rem 0.4375rem; border-radius: 999px; --_amber-bg: #FFF6E5; --_amber-text: #6B4A0E; background: var(--_amber-bg); color: var(--_amber-text); }
</style>
